; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR PI BY THE SPIGOT  -  the digits of pi, one at a time   (loads at $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot, type how many digits (1-1526; Enter alone = 100). The digits
; come out as they are found: 3. then groups of ten, fifty to a line. Y runs
; it again, N quits.
;
; The Rabinowitz-Wagon spigot: an array of small numbers, all 2 to start, is
; multiplied by 10 and normalised from the far end each pass; the next digit
; falls out of the front. Whole numbers only. Each pass skips the terms that
; no longer matter (half the work), and each pass over the array is raw 1802
; (RUNMC $4730, Firmware-Math/pi_native.asm): no multiply at all, 24-bit
; sums - 18x faster than bytecode. On the Elf2K: 100 digits ~27 s, 300 ~3 min,
; 1000 ~31 min, 1526 ~72 min. Uses $4000-$6FFF (SETSIZE 3). Plain text.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/pi_verify.py, V0061.34): PASS 2026-10-01 - algorithm vs a reference pi for 321 counts up to 1526 (incl. the Feynman point) with the native bounds (q < 128, 24-bit sums, a[i] high byte never $CD); the program's whole transcript byte-exact for 1, 2, 3, 11, 100, 101, 300 digits, junk answers, Y/N, and a rerun from dirty RAM.
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-10-01 - Craig: "Pi works."
;
; 227 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 F2 03          SETSIZE 03                         three 4 KB blocks: $4000-$6FFF (the array)
; D 4003 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A                    Ten
; D 4007 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000                    RB = 0: the index for variables
; D 400B 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 400E 2F 0B 06 5C    WRITEIDX R11 065C                  NBUF ends in a 0
; D 4012 11 0E 03 00    LOADXI R14 0300
; D 4016 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; ASKN:
; D 4018 11 0E 04 BA    LOADXI R14 04BA
; D 401C C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 401E 11 0C 06 5E    LOADXI R12 065E
; D 4022 11 0D 06 5E    LOADXI R13 065E
; D 4026 C2 CD          GETSTR R12 R13                     Read the line (echoed; backspace works)
; D 4028 BD 02 27       CALL PARSE
; D 402B 8C 0D          TESTXZ R13
; D 402D A1 00 37       IFFALSEI PN
; D 4030 11 0A 00 64    LOADXI R10 0064                    Enter alone: the default
; D 4034 B0 00 55       GAL PG
; PN:
; D 4037 86 0D FF FE    TESTXI R13 FFFE
; D 403B A0 00 4C       IFTRUEI PBADN
; D 403E 8C 0A          TESTXZ R10
; D 4040 A0 00 4C       IFTRUEI PBADN
; D 4043 11 0C 05 F7    LOADXI R12 05F7
; D 4047 89 AC          TESTLXY R10 < R12
; D 4049 A0 00 55       IFTRUEI PG
; PBADN:
; D 404C 11 0E 04 E8    LOADXI R14 04E8
; D 4050 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4052 B0 00 18       GAL ASKN
; PG:
; D 4055 23 00 A9       COPYXY R10 -> R9                   n = digits to print
; D 4058 23 00 98       COPYXY R9 -> R8
; D 405B 52 08 00 06    ADDXI R8 0006                      N = n + GUARD digits computed
; D 405F 23 00 81       COPYXY R8 -> R1
; D 4062 4A 1F          MULTXY R1 * R15
; D 4064 21 11          COPYAX MA -> R1
; D 4066 11 06 00 03    LOADXI R6 0003
; D 406A 4D 16          DIVXY R1 / R6
; D 406C 25             COPYMAA
; D 406D 21 01          COPYAX Acc -> R1
; D 406F 52 01 00 04    ADDXI R1 0004                      L = 10 N / 3 + MARGIN terms
; D 4073 11 0E 08 06    LOADXI R14 0806
; D 4077 3A 02 1E       COPYXMY R1 -> M(R14)               L for the native INIT
; D 407A F1 47 00       RUNMC 4700                         a[1..L] = 2, in raw 1802
; D 407D 11 07 00 00    LOADXI R7 0000                     no passes yet
; D 4081 11 0A 00 00    LOADXI R10 0000                    nothing printed
; D 4085 11 0C 00 00    LOADXI R12 0000                    no nines held
; D 4089 11 0D FF FF    LOADXI R13 FFFF                    no digit held
; D 408D 11 0E 05 11    LOADXI R14 0511
; D 4091 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; PASS:
; D 4093 87 A9          TESTXY R10 = R9
; D 4095 A0 01 31       IFTRUEI FIN                        all the digits asked for are out
; D 4098 87 78          TESTXY R7 = R8
; D 409A A0 01 1A       IFTRUEI FLUSH                      N passes done (a long run of 9s): print what is held
; D 409D 51 87 01       SUBXYZ R8 - R7 -> R1
; D 40A0 4A 1F          MULTXY R1 * R15
; D 40A2 21 11          COPYAX MA -> R1
; D 40A4 11 06 00 03    LOADXI R6 0003
; D 40A8 4D 16          DIVXY R1 / R6
; D 40AA 25             COPYMAA
; D 40AB 21 01          COPYAX Acc -> R1
; D 40AD 52 01 00 04    ADDXI R1 0004                      i = 10 (N - passes) / 3 + MARGIN: the terms that still matter
; D 40B1 11 0E 08 04    LOADXI R14 0804
; D 40B5 3A 02 1E       COPYXMY R1 -> M(R14)               TOP for the native PASS
; D 40B8 F1 47 30       RUNMC 4730                         the whole pass in raw 1802: a[TOP..1], then a[1] = q mod 10
; D 40BB 2E 0B 08 08    READIDX R11 0808
; D 40BF 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4                   R4 = the new digit (0-10)
; D 40C1 42 07          INCX R7
; D 40C3 86 04 00 09    TESTXI R4 0009
; D 40C7 A1 00 CF       IFFALSEI N9
; D 40CA 42 0C          INCX R12                           a 9: held with the others
; D 40CC B0 00 93       GAL PASS
; N9:
; D 40CF 86 04 00 0A    TESTXI R4 000A
; D 40D3 A1 00 F6       IFFALSEI NORM
; D 40D6 23 00 D6       COPYXY R13 -> R6
; D 40D9 42 06          INCX R6
; D 40DB BD 01 87       CALL OUTD
; Z0:
; D 40DE 8C 0C          TESTXZ R12
; D 40E0 A0 00 EF       IFTRUEI Z1
; D 40E3 11 06 00 00    LOADXI R6 0000
; D 40E7 BD 01 87       CALL OUTD
; D 40EA 43 0C          DECX R12
; D 40EC B0 00 DE       GAL Z0
; Z1:
; D 40EF 11 0D 00 00    LOADXI R13 0000                    and 0 is held
; D 40F3 B0 00 93       GAL PASS
; NORM:
; D 40F6 86 0D FF FF    TESTXI R13 FFFF
; D 40FA A0 01 14       IFTRUEI NH                         the very first digit: nothing held yet
; D 40FD 23 00 D6       COPYXY R13 -> R6
; D 4100 BD 01 87       CALL OUTD
; N90:
; D 4103 8C 0C          TESTXZ R12
; D 4105 A0 01 14       IFTRUEI NH
; D 4108 11 06 00 09    LOADXI R6 0009
; D 410C BD 01 87       CALL OUTD
; D 410F 43 0C          DECX R12
; D 4111 B0 01 03       GAL N90
; NH:
; D 4114 23 00 4D       COPYXY R4 -> R13                   this digit is held
; D 4117 B0 00 93       GAL PASS
; FLUSH:
; D 411A 23 00 D6       COPYXY R13 -> R6
; D 411D BD 01 87       CALL OUTD
; FL9:
; D 4120 8C 0C          TESTXZ R12
; D 4122 A0 01 31       IFTRUEI FIN
; D 4125 11 06 00 09    LOADXI R6 0009
; D 4129 BD 01 87       CALL OUTD
; D 412C 43 0C          DECX R12
; D 412E B0 01 20       GAL FL9
; FIN:
; D 4131 11 0E 05 23    LOADXI R14 0523
; D 4135 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4137 23 00 9A       COPYXY R9 -> R10
; D 413A BD 01 D5       CALL NUM
; D 413D 11 0E 05 32    LOADXI R14 0532
; D 4141 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4143 11 0E 05 41    LOADXI R14 0541
; D 4147 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; AW:
; D 4149 CC             SERST
; D 414A A1 01 49       IFFALSEI AW
; D 414D CB             SERIN
; D 414E 21 0A          COPYAX Acc -> R10
; D 4150 86 0A 00 79    TESTXI R10 0079
; D 4154 A0 01 76       IFTRUEI YES
; D 4157 86 0A 00 59    TESTXI R10 0059
; D 415B A0 01 76       IFTRUEI YES
; D 415E 86 0A 00 6E    TESTXI R10 006E
; D 4162 A0 01 7B       IFTRUEI NO
; D 4165 86 0A 00 4E    TESTXI R10 004E
; D 4169 A0 01 7B       IFTRUEI NO
; D 416C 86 0A 00 1B    TESTXI R10 001B
; D 4170 A0 01 7B       IFTRUEI NO
; D 4173 B0 01 49       GAL AW
; YES:
; D 4176 CA 59          SEROUTI 59 'Y'                     echo it
; D 4178 B0 00 18       GAL ASKN
; NO:
; D 417B CA 4E          SEROUTI 4E 'N'
; D 417D 11 0E 05 55    LOADXI R14 0555
; D 4181 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4183 00             HALT
; D 4184 F0 00 00       BREAK
; OUTD:
; D 4187 87 A9          TESTXY R10 = R9
; D 4189 A0 01 D3       IFTRUEI ODR
; D 418C 22 06          COPYXA R6 -> Acc
; D 418E 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4191 C9             SEROUT                             the digit
; D 4192 42 0A          INCX R10
; D 4194 86 0A 00 01    TESTXI R10 0001
; D 4198 A1 01 A3       IFFALSEI OD2
; D 419B 11 0E 05 18    LOADXI R14 0518
; D 419F C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       3.
; D 41A1 BE 00          RETURN
; OD2:
; D 41A3 87 A9          TESTXY R10 = R9
; D 41A5 A0 01 D3       IFTRUEI ODR                        the last one: no gap after it
; D 41A8 23 00 A6       COPYXY R10 -> R6
; D 41AB 43 06          DECX R6
; D 41AD 11 0E 00 32    LOADXI R14 0032
; D 41B1 4D 6E          DIVXY R6 / R14
; D 41B3 27             COPYREMA
; D 41B4 81 00 00       TESTAI 0000
; D 41B7 A1 01 C2       IFFALSEI OD3
; D 41BA 11 0E 05 1C    LOADXI R14 051C
; D 41BE C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       fifty to a line
; D 41C0 BE 00          RETURN
; OD3:
; D 41C2 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 41C4 4D 6F          DIVXY R6 / R15
; D 41C6 27             COPYREMA
; D 41C7 81 00 00       TESTAI 0000
; D 41CA A1 01 D3       IFFALSEI ODR
; D 41CD 11 0E 05 1A    LOADXI R14 051A
; D 41D1 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       groups of ten
; ODR:
; D 41D3 BE 00          RETURN
; NUM:
; D 41D5 4D AF          DIVXY R10 / R15
; D 41D7 27             COPYREMA
; D 41D8 21 0C          COPYAX Acc -> R12
; D 41DA 25             COPYMAA
; D 41DB 21 0A          COPYAX Acc -> R10                  RC = units, RA = n / 10
; D 41DD 2E 0C 05 F4    READIDX R12 05F4
; D 41E1 2F 0B 06 5B    WRITEIDX R11 065B
